    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Factions, a multiplayer game where strategy and survival go hand-in-hand. Each faction has its own Home map, where members respawn after death. Raiding factions must extract to survive, adding a unique twist to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in fictional environments around the world, in a post-war setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind for loot or relax with gameplay similar to arcade shooters. Customize your character's look and personalize their plate carrier with unique gear and patches. Factions offers a versatile gaming experience, whether you're strategizing for your next raid or enjoying some casual gameplay.<br><br>Factions is still currently under development. I am a solo developer who has been learning game development for around 9 years, and this is my first full release! I'm all in with this project and excited to share it with all of you. Stay tuned for more news and updates!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Factions, a multiplayer game where strategy and survival go hand-in-hand. Each faction has its own Home map, where members respawn after death. Raiding factions must extract to survive, adding a unique twist to the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in fictional environments around the world, in a post-war setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind for loot or relax with gameplay similar to arcade shooters. Customize your character's look and personalize their plate carrier with unique gear and patches. Factions offers a versatile gaming experience, whether you're strategizing for your next raid or enjoying some casual gameplay.<br><br>Factions is still currently under development. I am a solo developer who has been learning game development for around 9 years, and this is my first full release! I'm all in with this project and excited to share it with all of you. Stay tuned for more news and updates!</p>",
    "short_description": "Join your faction, and fight for survival in this exciting third person shooter.",
